# LeakSanitizer suppressions for code we do not own.
# Mesa's EGL/llvmpipe driver keeps a few process-lifetime allocations made
# while SDL initialises the offscreen EGL display (frames below are in the
# driver, which has no symbols).
leak:SDL_EGL_InitializeOffscreen
# Indirect allocations the driver makes during draw calls hang off the EGL
# display above. cadv_renderer_frame itself never allocates; anything below it
# is inside the GL driver (unsymbolised because Mesa is dlopen'ed and unloaded).
leak:cadv_renderer_frame
